  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">FY24-25 ASEAN Geothermal (Course 2) In-Country</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The course will be offered to 30 participants over 4 weeks. The course&#xa0;will cover an introduction to the fundamentals of geothermal energy, geothermal resources and development, and project management. The course will incorporate real-world examples and experience.
Course 2 will be delivered in April 2025, by University of Auckland.</narrative>
  </description>
